}</code></pre><p class="card__sub" data-evidence="none">No evidence pack was stored against this version.</p><div class="gatebox"><div class="gate"><span class="gate__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><div class="gate__word">Human approval gate</div><p class="gate__say" data-gate-expired="true" data-gate-state="expired">Gate expired, round 1<span data-gate="expired"> · deadline 2026-09-23T05:00:00.000Z passed with no decision</span></p></div></div><div class="sout__box"><div class="sout__row"><span class="tf__k">Exact artefact</span><span class="sb__state">v1 <span class="sbact__meta">digest-1</span></span></div></div><div class="btnrow gatebox__acts" data-decide="controls"><p class="card__sub" data-decide="closed">This gate expired: its deadline, 2026-09-23T05:00:00.000Z, passed without a decision, on the server’s own clock, so nobody may decide it now. A new version of the proposal raises a new gate.</p></div></div></div></article></div><form class="taskform" id="task-propose"><div class="sb__sh"><span class="sb__k">Propose something</span></div><div class="field"><label class="tf__k" for="propose-purpose">What it is for</label><input class="input" id="propose-purpose" pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,62}" required="" title="Lower case, digits and underscores, starting with a letter." type="text" value=""><p class="card__sub">Lower case, digits and underscores, such as client_renewal_quote.</p></div><div class="field"><label class="tf__k" for="propose-maximum">The most it may spend</label><input class="input" id="propose-maximum" min="0" required="" step="0.01" type="number" value=""></div><div class="field"><label class="tf__k" for="propose-currency">In</label><select class="input" id="propose-currency"><option value="AUD">AUD</option></select></div><button class="btn btn--primary" data-propose="submit" type="submit">Propose</button></form></section></div><aside class="tpg__side"></aside></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
`;

